      "author_handle": "katiepickard",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 8 years 3 months ago",
      "body": "Hey everyone, thanks for taking the time to read this.\nI'm a teacher and foster mum, and I am starting an e-commerce company to help me support my foster kids and looking for ideas for products and a brand. I want to supply toys and games that can help parents combat the battle with technology especially during the fall & winter season. The product ideas I have so far are:\nSlime making kit\nIndoor Teepee\nKids Chef Set\nKids Golf Set\nBowling Set\nYour ideas thoughts and feedback on products you would like to see more of out there, or things you've found that have caught on well with your kids, will be much more interesting than what I’ve come up with so far. Any ideas, comments or feedback is greatly appreciated – thank you so very much for being a part of this! 🙂",
